{
  "name": "@microspec/core",
  "version": "1.2.15",
  "license": "MIT",
  "publish": {
    "exclude": [
      "docs/",
      ".github/",
      "CONTRIBUTING.md",
      "tools/art/frame.mjs",
      "tools/art/frame.importmap.json"
    ]
  },
  "//imports": "npm: pins for the bare specifiers the runtime graph carries — JSR rejects https deps, and these make the graph analyzable at publish. The BROWSER never sees them: apps resolve the same bare names through their own index.html import map (esm.sh), and the published files ship verbatim.",
  "imports": {
    "preact": "npm:preact@10.27.1",
    "preact/hooks": "npm:preact@10.27.1/hooks",
    "preact/compat": "npm:preact@10.27.1/compat",
    "htm/preact": "npm:htm@3.1.1/preact",
    "nanostores": "npm:nanostores@0.11.4",
    "@nanostores/persistent": "npm:@nanostores/persistent@0.10.2",
    "@nanostores/preact": "npm:@nanostores/preact@0.5.2",
    "d3-geo": "npm:d3-geo@3",
    "topojson-client": "npm:topojson-client@3",
    "linkedom": "npm:linkedom@0.18.5",
    "tailwindcss": "npm:tailwindcss@4.3.3",
    "daisyui": "npm:daisyui@5"
  },
  "//": "Farm workspace root. The farm IS its own monorepo framework — Deno workspaces + a tiny affected orchestrator (tools/affected.mjs) — so there is NO Turborepo/Nx and NO node_modules. Packages below are workspace members; apps stay pure Deno (resolved at serve time by each index.html import map); CI verifies only the apps a change actually reaches.",
  "tasks": {
    "test": "deno test -A packages/runtime/runtime_test.js",
    "dts": "deno run -A tools/dts.mjs",
    "docart": "deno run -A tools/art/docart.mjs",
    "demo": "deno run -A tools/demo.mjs",
    "affected": "deno run -A tools/affected.mjs",
    "verify": "deno run -A packages/gates/verify.mjs",
    "gates": "deno run -A tools/8n8/run.mjs gates",
    "8n8": "deno run -A tools/8n8/run.mjs",
    "kit": "deno run -A tools/kit-manifest.mjs",
    "shell": "deno run -A tools/shell-gen.mjs",
    "red": "gh run view $(gh run list --workflow=verify.yml --limit 1 --json databaseId --jq '.[0].databaseId') --log-failed | sed 's/\\x1b\\[[0-9;]*m//g' | grep -E '✗'"
  },
  "lint": {
    "exclude": [
      "dist/",
      "apps/"
    ]
  },
  "fmt": {
    "exclude": [
      "dist/",
      "apps/",
      "packages/"
    ]
  },
  "//gates": "THE pre-push block, now an 8n8 flow (tools/8n8/nodes.mjs) instead of a `&&` chain. Same checks, one superset node (the registry's own contract test), 45.5s -> 24.4s measured, because independent nodes have no reason to be sequential. The reason it stopped being `&&`: a chain stops at the FIRST red, so one round answers one boolean and the next four failures stay hidden — and `deno task gates | grep ...` returns grep's exit code, which is how a red farm got pushed. The runner runs every node whose dependencies are green, prints each failure IN FULL with its node id and argv, and exits non-zero on the count. Running all but one of these is how a stale service-worker manifest reached CI twice, so `sw` is a node, not a habit: an import graph changes the moment a view adopts a kit component. `kit` is the same shape one level up - tools/mcp/kit.json is GENERATED from packages/runtime/ui.js, so touching the kit without `deno task kit` leaves every agent reading a signature that no longer exists.",
  "//8n8": "The pipeline registry itself. `deno task 8n8 --list` prints every node, whether it is a deterministic script or still an agent hand-off, and the share of the pipeline that no longer needs a model. n8n has a human draw the graph and a machine run it; here the agent does the work and a run that proved itself FREEZES into a script node - packages/gen/authorless.mjs is the existence proof. The number only goes up.",
  "//red": "Print CI failures IN FULL. Never pipe this through `cut` or `head -c`: the gate names the offending element and its geometry, and truncating that turns a measurement back into a guess — three commits were spent moving the wrong element because its class name was cut at 170 characters.",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./packages/runtime/index.js",
    "./runtime/account.js": "./packages/runtime/account.js",
    "./runtime/ai-core.js": "./packages/runtime/ai-core.js",
    "./runtime/ai-text.js": "./packages/runtime/ai-text.js",
    "./runtime/apk.js": "./packages/runtime/apk.js",
    "./runtime/audio.js": "./packages/runtime/audio.js",
    "./runtime/auth.js": "./packages/runtime/auth.js",
    "./runtime/authwall.js": "./packages/runtime/authwall.js",
    "./runtime/bghold.js": "./packages/runtime/bghold.js",
    "./runtime/build.js": "./packages/runtime/build.js",
    "./runtime/camprime.js": "./packages/runtime/camprime.js",
    "./runtime/colour.js": "./packages/runtime/colour.js",
    "./runtime/console.js": "./packages/runtime/console.js",
    "./runtime/db.js": "./packages/runtime/db.js",
    "./runtime/deck.js": "./packages/runtime/deck.js",
    "./runtime/dpad.js": "./packages/runtime/dpad.js",
    "./runtime/dust.js": "./packages/runtime/dust.js",
    "./runtime/enrich.js": "./packages/runtime/enrich.js",
    "./runtime/feed.js": "./packages/runtime/feed.js",
    "./runtime/fittext.js": "./packages/runtime/fittext.js",
    "./runtime/gate.js": "./packages/runtime/gate.js",
    "./runtime/geofix.js": "./packages/runtime/geofix.js",
    "./runtime/geomag.js": "./packages/runtime/geomag.js",
    "./runtime/gesture.js": "./packages/runtime/gesture.js",
    "./runtime/globe.js": "./packages/runtime/globe.js",
    "./runtime/glstage.js": "./packages/runtime/glstage.js",
    "./runtime/groove.js": "./packages/runtime/groove.js",
    "./runtime/hdr.js": "./packages/runtime/hdr.js",
    "./runtime/hero.js": "./packages/runtime/hero.js",
    "./runtime/i18n.js": "./packages/runtime/i18n.js",
    "./runtime/imagejob.js": "./packages/runtime/imagejob.js",
    "./runtime/imgsize.js": "./packages/runtime/imgsize.js",
    "./runtime/index.js": "./packages/runtime/index.js",
    "./runtime/intake.js": "./packages/runtime/intake.js",
    "./runtime/lastgen.js": "./packages/runtime/lastgen.js",
    "./runtime/localize.js": "./packages/runtime/localize.js",
    "./runtime/material.js": "./packages/runtime/material.js",
    "./runtime/mediasession.js": "./packages/runtime/mediasession.js",
    "./runtime/melody.js": "./packages/runtime/melody.js",
    "./runtime/notify.js": "./packages/runtime/notify.js",
    "./runtime/orbit.js": "./packages/runtime/orbit.js",
    "./runtime/overlay.js": "./packages/runtime/overlay.js",
    "./runtime/permissions.js": "./packages/runtime/permissions.js",
    "./runtime/pkgroot.js": "./packages/runtime/pkgroot.js",
    "./runtime/playback.js": "./packages/runtime/playback.js",
